    "text": "Fram adame \u00feam \u00e6restan m\u00e6nn, & fram fr\u00e6m\u00f0e middangeardes o\u00f0 \u00f0ane flod w\u00e6s gergerimes twahund\n\u00deonne fram \u00f0am flode o\u00f0 abrahames acennesse w\u00e6ron niogen hund wintra, & twa & feowertig.\n\u00d0onne fram habrahame o\u00f0 moyses, & israhela utgange of egiptum w\u00e6ron fif hund wintra & eac fife.\n\u00d0onne fram moyse o\u00f0 salomon & o\u00f0 \u00f0\u00e6t frumgeweorc \u00f0\u00e6s temples on hierusal\u00e6m w\u00e6ron feower hund\nFram fruman middangearde o\u00f0 cristes hidercyme w\u00ebron fif\u00f0usendo wintro & twa hund & eahta &\nFram frym\u00f0e middangeardes o\u00f0 \u00f0\u00e6s templ\u00e6s geweorc w\u00e6ron fiow\u00e6r \u00f0usenda wintra & seofan &\nAnd \u00f0ara werhtana w\u00e6s, \u00fee \u00f0ane stan b\u00e6ron to \u00f0am geweorce, hundsiofentig \u00f0usenda, & hundeahtodig\nAnd \u00f0ara werhtena \u00fee \u00f0an\u00e6 stan sneoddon & fegdon, \u00feara w\u00e6s hund siofentig \u00f0usenda & \u00f0rio hund.\nAnd \u00f0anan w\u00e6s to cristes \u00f0rowunga Twa \u00f0usenda wintra And seofen & \u00f0ritig.\nAnd \u00f0anne w\u00e6s fram frem\u00f0e middangeardes o\u00f0 romeburhge geweorc fiow\u00e6r \u00f0usendo wintro, & siofen",
